---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Visit | Christian Church Maui | Maui OPC"
  description="Planning to visit a Reformed church on Maui? Here's what to expect when you worship with us — and how to get connected before we launch."
  canonical="https://reformedchurchmaui.com/visit/"
  h1="Plan Your Visit"
  breadcrumb={[{ name: 'Visit', url: 'https://reformedchurchmaui.com/visit/' }]}
>
  <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-[#1E2A3A] mt-2 mb-4">When and where</h2>
  <p class="text-[#5F5E5A] leading-relaxed mb-10">
    We are currently in the church plant phase — services have not yet begun. We're forming community now and will announce our first service date via email. Sign up below to be the first to know.
  </p>

  <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-[#1E2A3A] mt-10 mb-4">What to expect</h2>
  <p class="text-[#5F5E5A] leading-relaxed mb-4">
    When services begin, here's what a typical Sunday will look like at our church:
  </p>
  <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-[#5F5E5A] space-y-2 mb-10 pl-2">
    <li>A call to worship opening the service</li>
    <li>Singing of psalms and hymns</li>
    <li>Prayer</li>
    <li>Scripture reading</li>
    <li>Preaching from the Bible text</li>
    <li>The Lord's Supper (celebrated regularly)</li>
    <li>Benediction</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-[#1E2A3A] mt-10 mb-4">Who should come</h2>
  <p class="text-[#5F5E5A] leading-relaxed mb-10">
    Everyone is welcome. If you've been looking for confessional Reformed worship on Maui, this is for you. If you're new to Reformed theology and just curious, come and see. We're a church for anyone who wants to hear the Bible taught carefully and worship God sincerely.
  </p>

  <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-[#1E2A3A] mt-10 mb-4">Families and children</h2>
  <p class="text-[#5F5E5A] leading-relaxed mb-12">
    [Placeholder — children's ministry plans to be confirmed with Chris]
  </p>

  <div class="border-t border-[#D3D1C7] pt-10">
    <p class="text-[#5F5E5A] mb-4">Get connected to hear when we launch.</p>
    <a href="/connect/" class="inline-block bg-[#C4A35A] text-[#1E2A3A] font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded hover:bg-[#d4b36a] transition-colors">
      Get connected &rarr;
    </a>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
